			"notes": "- Auto-renews experiments (if possible) when clicking on the experiment NPC\n- Adds an option to disable the \"Hey! You can't PvP here\" message\n- Auto-sell has a lower likelihood to kick you when you log in and while you play\n- Command-based functionality (like loading certain stats and kill messages) now only activate when logged into Dragnet (to avoid running commands on other servers where such commands may not exist - allows for cross-server play without having to change your mod setup)\n- Added a reset button to the UI (in the bottom left corner) to reset your UI elements\n- (Mostly) fixed up the UI elements going crazy when colliding with the edge of the screen"
